ggml / llama.cpp — https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp

The IQ2_S, IQ3_XXS and IQ3_S lattice codebooks in
crates/airun-gguf/src/iq_grids.rs and crates/airun-cuda/kernels/iq_grids.cuh
are generated from ggml's ggml-common.h. The GGUF format, the quantization
block layouts, the GBNF grammar syntax and the JSON-schema-to-grammar
primitives follow ggml and llama.cpp so that files and requests are
interchangeable; the HTTP API follows llama-server's.

